# More of game.things and game.factions (P1-01, P1-04).

@kit domain=things op=thing subject=thing:RimThingRef title="Things" page=things
minify() -> RimThing | Turns a minifiable building into a minified item in place. Returns the minified thing.
inner() -> RimThing? | The thing inside a minified item.
style() -> string? | The style def name of the thing.
set_style(style?: string) -> boolean | Sets the style by def name, or clears it when nil.
owners() -> RimPawn[] | Pawns assigned to this thing, for beds and similar. Raises RK3003 when it cannot be assigned.
assign_owner(pawn: RimPawn) -> boolean | Assigns a pawn to a bed or other assignable thing.
unassign_owner(pawn: RimPawn) -> boolean | Removes an assignment.
storage_allows(def: string) -> boolean | Whether a storage building or stockpile accepts a thing def.
storage_set_allowed(def: string, allowed: boolean) -> boolean | Changes what a storage building accepts.
storage_priority() -> string | Unstored, Low, Normal, Preferred, Important or Critical.
set_storage_priority(priority: string) -> string | Sets the storage priority.

@kit domain=factions op=faction subject=faction:RimFactionRef title="Factions" page=factions
remove() -> boolean | Removes a temporary faction. Raises RK1001 for any other faction.
make_peace() -> string | Sets the relation with the player to Neutral, with the game's letter. Returns the relation.
declare_war() -> string | Sets the relation with the player to Hostile.
send_gift(things: RimThing[]) -> integer | Consumes the items and raises goodwill by market value / 40, at most 40. Returns the new goodwill.

@kit domain=factions op=faction subject=none title="Factions" page=factions
make_temporary(def: string, name?: string) -> RimFaction | Generates a temporary faction from a faction def, for quests and events.
